{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","chunk_index":7,"job_id":"mwjob_dfe2e471ead95adc895c5484","precondition_digest":"c5d6cf222be6ad3fb61ec35bf2651efa7d3705de7dd2dc6e398e812469cbabc3","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v2","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_42f4fa79abc0cfdc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b2568b149c433676","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b1a29c067cba5951","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_060d398405a8454b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_39e4b116abc0cd5e","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_88e2c46a69d01a79","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_safety_endpoints","span_corpus_ae_invasive","span_corpus_ae_record"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"不良事件","proposal_text":"不良事件是临床研究中受试者接受试验药物后出现的任何不良医学事件，无论其严重程度以及是否与试验药物存在相关性，均应纳入安全性观察和记录范围。本研究将治疗期间出现的不良事件作为安全性终点之一，评价其在试验组与匹配安慰剂组之间的发生情况。研究者应在受试者进入研究后持续关注不良事件的发生，按照统一要求完成识别、记录、评估和随访，并确保相关信息可溯源。对于诊断性或治疗性操作本身，不应作为不良事件报告，但导致该操作的疾病状况若符合不良事件特征，则应作为不良事件记录。","rationale":"依据当前项目安全性终点和共享语料中不良事件与侵入性操作记录的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对项目级不良事件定义和分级标准。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_42f4fa79abc0cfdc","section_number":"8.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_safety_endpoints","span_corpus_researcher_record","span_corpus_followup"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"严重不良事件","proposal_text":"严重不良事件是安全性评价中的重点关注类别，研究者应对每例严重不良事件进行及时识别、记录和评估，并判断其与试验药物的相关性。本研究将严重不良事件发生率列入安全性终点，评价其在不同治疗组中的发生情况。对于达到严重性标准的事件，应按照适用监管要求和研究安全性报告流程进行报告，并确保报告信息与源文件一致。严重不良事件的随访应持续至事件转归、稳定或获得可解释的医学结论，相关记录应能够支持后续安全性汇总分析。","rationale":"依据当前项目安全性终点和共享语料中研究者记录与报告职责的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对严重不良事件判定标准和报告时限。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b2568b149c433676","section_number":"8.2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_safety_endpoints","span_corpus_researcher_record","span_corpus_followup"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"可疑且非预期严重不良反应","proposal_text":"可疑且非预期严重不良反应属于研究期间需要特别关注的安全性信息，其识别依赖于对严重不良事件的严重性、与试验药物的相关性以及预期性的综合判断。研究者在对严重不良事件进行评价时，应结合已有参考安全信息判断该事件是否属于非预期情形，并记录判断依据。对于符合可疑且非预期严重不良反应特征的事件，应按照适用监管要求和研究安全性报告流程进行处理，确保信息及时传递并保留完整记录。该类事件的随访与报告应在整个研究期间持续进行，以支持对试验药物安全性的持续评估。","rationale":"依据当前项目安全性终点和共享语料中研究者记录与随访职责的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对预期性判断依据、报告时限和报告路径。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b1a29c067cba5951","section_number":"8.2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_dosing","span_study_dose_schedule","span_study_periods","span_study_safety_endpoints"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究药物相关风险","proposal_text":"本研究试验药物为合成试验药A，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂，属于全身暴露的小分子药物。试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期为16周，之后设4周安全性随访期。基于当前研究设计，研究药物相关风险主要通过治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率进行评价，同时关注实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。研究期间应持续收集上述安全性信息，并按照统一要求进行记录、评估和报告，以支持风险与获益的持续评价。","rationale":"依据当前项目试验干预、剂量与给药方案、研究时期及安全性终点；医学作者需核对研究药物已知风险和需重点监测的安全性指标。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_060d398405a8454b","section_number":"8.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_corpus_ae_record","span_corpus_researcher_record","span_corpus_followup"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"不良事件的采集与记录","proposal_text":"研究期间，研究者应将所有不良事件及其相关随访信息记录在受试者源文件和病例报告表中，记录内容应足以支持安全性评价和溯源。每例次不良事件均应记录必要的临床信息，并在综合考虑受试者基础疾病、合并用药及非药物治疗的基础上评价其与试验药物的相关性。对于严重不良事件，还应确保相关随访信息完整记录并可溯源。所有记录应由研究者审核并签名，保证数据真实、准确和完整。","rationale":"依据共享语料中不良事件记录、研究者职责和随访信息可溯源的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对项目eCRF字段、记录时限和签名要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_39e4b116abc0cd5e","section_number":"8.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_safety_endpoints","span_corpus_ae_record","span_corpus_researcher_record"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"不良事件的评估","proposal_text":"研究者应对每例次不良事件进行医学评估，包括严重程度和严重性判断，以及对试验药物相关性的评价。严重程度评估应结合事件的临床特征和对受试者日常功能的影响进行分级，严重性判断应关注事件是否达到严重不良事件标准。相关性评价应综合考虑受试者基础疾病、合并用药、时间关系及去激发或再激发等信息，并在病例报告表中记录判断结果和依据。对于安全性终点所关注的治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，应确保评估口径一致，以支持组间安全性比较。","rationale":"依据当前项目安全性终点和共享语料中研究者评估严重性、严重程度及相关性的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对项目指定分级标准和相关性判定规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86","section_number":"8.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_safety_endpoints","span_corpus_researcher_record","span_corpus_followup"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"不良事件的报告","proposal_text":"研究者应按照适用法规和研究安全性报告流程，将研究期间识别的不良事件和严重不良事件报告给申办者。报告内容应与源文件和病例报告表中的记录一致，并足以支持对事件严重性、严重程度和与试验药物相关性的评价。对于严重不良事件，应在识别后及时完成报告，并根据监管要求提交后续随访信息。可疑且非预期严重不良反应应按照适用监管要求进行处理和报告。所有安全性报告均应保留完整记录，以便核查和汇总分析。","rationale":"依据当前项目安全性终点和共享语料中向申办者报告及记录可溯源的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对报告时限、报告路径和报告表格要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_88e2c46a69d01a79","section_number":"8.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921152117_594f52b5","evidence_span_ids":["span_study_safety_endpoints","span_study_periods","span_corpus_followup"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"不良事件的随访","proposal_text":"不良事件发生后，研究者应对受试者进行适当随访，直至事件转归、恢复至基线水平、稳定或获得可解释的医学结论。随访内容应包括事件的临床过程、处理措施、实验室检查及其他相关检查结果，并记录在受试者源文件和病例报告表中。对于严重不良事件和导致停药的不良事件，应特别关注其后续变化和最终转归，确保安全性信息完整。研究结束或受试者提前退出时，仍应对未恢复的不良事件进行必要随访，并按照适用要求完成安全性报告。","rationale":"依据当前项目安全性终点、研究时期和共享语料中不良事件相关随访信息记录的监管语境措辞；医学作者需核对随访终止条件和研究结束后的安全性报告要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15","section_number":"8.7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:d35759ecf4a685fcce11b6e7","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"64b04e91dc5a54deebaddb65941bd243aba6b4995c888fb3bc6ace3d1cb25412"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的收集与记录|block:713|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:100e0300d2949b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"ae2e5ed819c840f883cc928c6e69bc3fbdbb3327977aeffb86a679b27700b0e5"},{"locator":"section:治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）|block:671|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"363e16249ca6a2c3ff0ae1da9497be4bfa903b7a8fff2c7e770b6400d6b9c762"},{"locator":"section:8.4.9.2 不良事件|block:1136|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a4dbbca5ee93dd8afdc70483dd7648214180490ccefcd4eceab6680c02415d81"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的采集与记录|block:678|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"4ecf3eb61d3e778bb07a7f178eae0696c795336bd5e5ebcebc5fba44ae18fa34"},{"locator":"section:应提供的安全信息资料及要求|block:796|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b527389c6837e6dd4863af7a361b384dfb01d86299c56b1917d11bc0534851fc"}]}